s","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"04l8PYcuYQeEkEhJCbhtOA","review_id":"eN_V16Hb7JNKPlqYAB68UQ","date":"2018-10-02T17:57:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9385614395141602,"text_excerpt":"WOW. My girlfriends and I had brunch here and it was everything I had hoped it would be. I got the Peacemaker which gave you the option to choose from two of their eggs Benedict's. I chose the Chicken St. Charles and Shrimp Boogaloo. The poached eggs on each were perfect. I preferred the Chicken St. Charles but loved the sauce on the Shrimp Boogaloo. The other items ordered were a breakfast sandwich with amazing candied bacon, pulled pork eggs Benedict and an omelette with goat cheese. All amazing. I got the creamy vanilla iced coffee to go and it was simply delicious. This location is fairly new and close to the French Quarter. You can put your name on a waitlist using the Yelp app which..."},{"business_id":"04l8PYcuYQeEkEhJCbhtOA","review_id":"T06rLSkobvhqiHZHTNAWOA","date":"2019-02-26T16:16:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9373102188110352,"text_excerpt":"Came here for breakfast with the wife on Monday morning. This was another spot recommended to me by my coworker. I was able to use the wait list feature from yelp to help secure a spot in line while we walked over from our hotel. We still had to wait about 10 minutes when we arrived as there were still two groups ahead of us. We waited outside as the wait area at the entrance got crowded very easily. Oddly enough, we were audience to a street sign across the street that seemed to be possessed. It swung violently from side to side and looked like it was about to break from its mounting and hit some unfortunate bastard walking on the sidewalk below. Nevertheless it didn't happen but it help..."},{"business_id":"04l8PYcuYQeEkEhJCbhtOA","review_id":"_gTTXUXCd3uZOSQBhqjNPg","date":"2022-01-05T03:36:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9345999956130981,"text_excerpt":"This is a great breakfast spot. I would highly recommend that you join the waiting list so you don't have to deal with the crazy wait times. This is a pretty busy and popular location. I ordered the chicken and French toast bites, and my gf ordered the eggs Benedict. Both were delicious and I would definitely order them again. For drinks we ordered the Bloody Mary and boozy coffee. This was probably the best Bloody Mary that I've ever tasted. They were not lying when they described it at award winning. Overall, this is a great restaurant. I would suggest that you stop by if in New Orleans. There is no parking so you will need to Uber or walk."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"04l8PYcuYQeEkEhJCbhtOA","photo_id":"DHbROrAyvpjLlZGEQsLA8Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/DHbROrAyvpjLlZGEQsLA8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8892175555229187},{"business_id":"04l8PYcuYQeEkEhJCbhtOA","photo_id":"_XEZOldvbcpDjV8nQjYLOg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_XEZOldvbcpDjV8nQjYLOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8829364776611328},{"business_id":"04l8PYcuYQeEkEhJCbhtOA","photo_id":"xwwjYUyogaDPHklAzbgghw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xwwjYUyo